// Application icon resource for the Windows executable (bitty#2929).
//
// Compiled by `build.rs` through `embed-resource` on Windows targets only, so
// Explorer, Windows Search, and the Start Menu shortcut show the Bitty icon
// instead of a generic executable one. The icon file is generated from
// `packaging/icons/hicolor/256x256/apps/bitty.png` (16/24/32/48/64/128/256 px
// entries).
//
// Paths here are resolved relative to this file's directory (the crate root),
// which is also the build script's working directory.
1 ICON "../../packaging/icons/bitty.ico"
